<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>{{title}} — Nimbus</title>
    <style>
        :root { --mono: ui-monospace, Menlo, Consolas, monospace; --sans: system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;
                --bg: #e8eaed; --surface: #fafbfc; --line: #d2d7de; --ink: #1b2027; --ink-2: #5a626d;
                --ok: #1f6b4a; --ok-soft: #e0efe7; --accent: #97671a; }
        * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; }
        body { font-family: var(--sans); background: var(--bg); color: var(--ink); padding: 3rem 1.5rem; }
        main { max-width: 40rem; margin: 0 auto; background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 4px; padding: 2rem; }
        .badge { display: inline-block; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: .75rem; padding: .2rem .6rem; border-radius: 3px; background: var(--ok-soft); color: var(--ok); }
        h1 { font-size: 1.4rem; margin: .75rem 0 1.25rem; }
        p { color: var(--ink-2); line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
        table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: .9rem; margin-bottom: 1.25rem; }
        th, td { text-align: left; padding: .45rem .6rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
        th { color: var(--ink-2); font-weight: 500; white-space: nowrap; }
        code { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: .85em; }
        nav a { color: var(--accent); margin-right: 1rem; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
    <span class="badge">signed in — any role</span>
    <h1>{{title}}</h1>
    <p>You are seeing this because you have a live Keycloak session. Any
       authenticated user of realm <code>{{realm}}</code> can reach this page —
       no particular role is required.</p>

    <table>
        <tr><th>User</th><td>{{name}}</td></tr>
        <tr><th>Username</th><td><code>{{username}}</code></td></tr>
        <tr><th>Email</th><td>{{email}}</td></tr>
        <tr><th>Roles</th><td>
            {{#has_roles}}{{#roles}}<code>{{name}}</code> {{/roles}}{{/has_roles}}
            {{^has_roles}}<em>none</em>{{/has_roles}}
        </td></tr>
    </table>

    <p>Compare with <a href="/admin">/admin</a>, which additionally requires
       the <code>admin</code> realm role.</p>

    <nav>
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <a href="/admin">/admin</a>
        <a href="/auth/logout?redirect=/">Sign out</a>
    </nav>
</main>
</body>
</html>
